oguelike, arcade game, you are the bad guy<br>Navigate your way through myriads of unfair matchups against the toughest ecosystem safeguards<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weave through:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>worm wardens</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/509ee647c8dc9cee8f5771856d16294b.poster.avif?t=1722583296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/509ee647c8dc9cee8f5771856d16294b.webm?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/509ee647c8dc9cee8f5771856d16294b.mp4?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>butterfly bouncers</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/1fcd45f0874fee72337a9a68c8d59d38.poster.avif?t=1722583296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/1fcd45f0874fee72337a9a68c8d59d38.webm?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/1fcd45f0874fee72337a9a68c8d59d38.mp4?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>bird barriers</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/dde7cc0219ae5a9a7b8cec24804c7a6f.poster.avif?t=1722583296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/dde7cc0219ae5a9a7b8cec24804c7a6f.webm?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/dde7cc0219ae5a9a7b8cec24804c7a6f.mp4?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>and duel defenders</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/5d1881065851d7117e1c6eaf62db5d6c.poster.avif?t=1722583296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/5d1881065851d7117e1c6eaf62db5d6c.webm?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/5d1881065851d7117e1c6eaf62db5d6c.mp4?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cool Stuff</h2><br><strong>-Randomized Runs</strong><br>Each wave is randomly ordered, with random enemy start points; no run will be the same!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/4d6bf06d4abc42c161f14e99d7741846.poster.avif?t=1722583296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/4d6bf06d4abc42c161f14e99d7741846.webm?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/4d6bf06d4abc42c161f14e99d7741846.mp4?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>-Pickup'n'Play</strong><br>Kamakazzzbee is easy to understand and start playing, with its minimalistic design, and its singular multifunctional dash ability<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/31461a2a84a88df060e5121919a67d4b.poster.avif?t=1722583296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/31461a2a84a88df060e5121919a67d4b.webm?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/31461a2a84a88df060e5121919a67d4b.mp4?t=1722583296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>-Difficulty</strong><br>You Will Die. A Ton. Like a Lot. Like you probably won't last a minute.  <i>(its pretty hard)</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/ab479dba889eaddcb91f678ca9625120.avif?t=1722583296\" /></div><br><br><strong>-Addicting Gameplay</strong><br>Hard hooking gameplay that only ends with you looking up new controllers<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/5952fb184e027cf61de99d92d880878c.avif?t=1722583296\" /></div>",
